Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: functions

    2 functions: function
    3          | functions function

    4 function: type ID LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
    5         | type ID LPAREN params RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
    6         | type ID LPAREN error RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

    7 params: param
    8       | params COMMA param
    9       | params error COMMA

   10 param: type ID
   11      | type ID LBRACKET RBRACKET
   12      | type error

   13 statements: /* empty */
   14           | statements statement
   15           | statements error SEMI

   16 statement: declaration
   17          | assignment SEMI
   18          | expr SEMI
   19          | if_statement
   20          | while_statement
   21          | for_statement
   22          | return_statement

   23 declaration: type id_list SEMI
   24            | type error SEMI

   25 type: INT
   26     | FLOAT
   27     | CHAR
   28     | DOUBLE

   29 id_list: var_decl
   30        | id_list COMMA var_decl
   31        | id_list error COMMA

   32 var_decl: ID
   33         | ID LBRACKET NUMBER RBRACKET
   34         | ID ASSIGN expr

   35 assignment: ID ASSIGN expr
   36           | ID LBRACKET expr RBRACKET ASSIGN expr

   37 if_statement: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   38             | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statements RBRACE
   39             | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN statement
   40             | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN statement ELSE statement
   41             | IF error LBRACE statements RBRACE

   42 while_statement: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   43                | WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN statement
   44                | WHILE error LBRACE statements RBRACE

   45 for_statement: FOR LPAREN assignment SEMI condition SEMI expr RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   46              | FOR LPAREN declaration condition SEMI expr RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   47              | FOR LPAREN error RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   48 return_statement: RETURN expr SEMI
   49                 | RETURN SEMI
   50                 | RETURN error SEMI

   51 condition: expr rel_op expr
   52          | expr

   53 rel_op: LT
   54       | GT
   55       | LE
   56       | GE
   57       | EQ
   58       | NE

   59 expr: expr PLUS expr
   60     | expr MINUS expr
   61     | expr MUL expr
   62     | expr DIV expr
   63     | expr LSHIFT expr
   64     | expr RSHIFT expr
   65     | LPAREN type RPAREN expr
   66     | LPAREN expr RPAREN
   67     | expr INC
   68     | ID
   69     | ID LBRACKET expr RBRACKET
   70     | NUMBER
   71     | FLOAT_VAL
   72     | STRING


